Delete a connection and clear its matching local readiness markers. If the connection is already absent, clear stale markers and succeed without prompting.

Usage
  azd ai connection delete <name> [flags]

Flags
      --force : Skip confirmation prompt

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string              : Sets the current working directory
      --debug                   : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string      : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help                    : help for delete
      --no-prompt               : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string           : The output format (default "default")
  -p, --project-endpoint string : Foundry project endpoint URL for connection operations only (not context or version)

Examples
  Delete a connection after confirmation
    azd ai connection delete my-search
